International seat share is calculated as seats on international departing segments divided by all departing seats (T-100). For every airport in FAA hub class L, the value for {F16.period} ranks as follows, highest first.

1. JFK {F16}
2. MIA {F21}
3. IAD {F14}
4. EWR {F11}
