The share at JFK exceeds the share at MIA by {F64} and exceeds the share at DCA by {F63}. A separate minmax score within this set is {F31} at JFK and {F60} at DCA. No two airports have the same share, so the order has no ties. This is a descriptive rank of one calculated metric, not an investment screen and not a valuation.
